You stole that song.

787
00:45:02,766 --> 00:45:04,733
Ambition.

788
00:45:04,802 --> 00:45:09,438
We might never have
known, but ambition

789
00:45:09,507 --> 00:45:11,440
got the better of you.

790
00:45:17,148 --> 00:45:18,748
Nothing further.

791
00:45:20,150 --> 00:45:21,862
Ladies and
gentlemen of the jury,

